      "And I'm with you 100%. This is software itself has been disappointing over the since basically uh last October, November when it peaked. This is our mega caps. This is a trillion dollar club and the year-to-date performance, you can see Microsoft by far the worst off there. It's below Tesla, meta, which are also in the red. And let me just show you a chart. This is going to be a two year of Microsoft and I'm going to put a 200 day moving average in there. You just mentioned it.",
